            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kümelerin aksine, <code>grocery_list</code> gibi listeler burada olduğu gibi <code>\"broccoli\"</code> gibi yinelenen değerlere izin verir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"grocery_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;broccoli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cereal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;broccoli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"broccoli\"</code>, ardından <code>\"broccoli\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Eliminate duplicates",
            "id": 89321,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>grocery_list</code> gibi bir listedeki tekrarları kaldırmak için onu <code>set()</code> ve parantezler arasındaki listeyle bir kümeye dönüştürebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"grocery_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;broccoli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cereal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;broccoli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(set(grocery_list))\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"82\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'broccoli', 'milk', 'cereal'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>set</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>grocery_list</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Store in variable",
            "id": 89322,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir liste üzerinde kullanıldığında <code>set()</code>, bize listedeki benzersiz değerlerden oluşan bir küme verir; bu kümeyi daha sonra <code>grocery_set</code> gibi bir değişkende saklayabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"grocery_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;broccoli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cereal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;broccoli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"grocery_set = set(grocery_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(grocery_set)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"90\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'broccoli', 'milk', 'cereal'}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>grocery_set</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>set(grocery_list)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>grocery_list</code> içindeki benzersiz değerleri <code>grocery_set</code> içinde sakla, ardından bu kümeyi göster.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"grocery_list = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;broccoli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;cereal&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;broccoli&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"grocery_set = set(grocery_list)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(grocery_set)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"list(grocery_list)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"grocery_list\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>grocery_set</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>set(grocery_list)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Lists and duplicates",
            "id": 89417,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kümelerle listeler arasındaki fark, yinelenen değerler açısından nedir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Listeler yinelenen öğelere izin verirken kümeler vermez</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kümeler yinelenen değerlere izin verirken listeler izin vermez</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Listeler yinelenen öğelere izin verirken kümeler vermez.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Listeler yinelenen değerlere izin verirken setler vermez.</p><p><code>tags = [\"new\", \"sale\", \"new\"]</code> için <code>tags</code> ve <code>set(tags)</code> kaç değer içerir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Liste <code>3</code>, set ise <code>2</code> değer içerir.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Her iki koleksiyon da <code>3</code> değer içerir.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Liste <code>2</code>, set ise <code>3</code> değer içerir.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Liste <code>3</code>, set ise <code>2</code> değer içerir.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
